# Generated artifacts

## UIO Definition

### ipc-shm

```dts
ipc-shm@20400000 {
    compatible = "generic-uio";
    reg = <0x0 0x20400000 0x0 0x4000 0x0 0x20404000 0x0 0x4000>;
    status = "okay";
};
```

### hsem

```dts
hsem@46240000 {
    compatible = "generic-uio";
    reg = <0x0 0x46240000 0x0 0x400>;
    interrupts = <GIC_SPI 199 IRQ_TYPE_LEVEL_HIGH>;
    status = "okay";
};
```

### ipcc2

```dts
ipcc2@46250000 {
    compatible = "generic-uio";
    reg = <0x0 0x46250000 0x0 0x400>;
    interrupts = <GIC_SPI 175 IRQ_TYPE_LEVEL_HIGH>;
    status = "okay";
};
```

## NVIC Initialization

### cm0p

```rust
fn _generated() {
    #[derive(Clone, Copy, Debug, Eq, PartialEq)]
    #[repr(u16)]
    pub enum BellaInterrupt {
        IPCC2 = 13u16,
    }
    unsafe impl ::cortex_m::interrupt::InterruptNumber for BellaInterrupt {
        fn number(self) -> u16 {
            self as u16
        }
    }
    unsafe {
        ::cortex_m::peripheral::NVIC::unmask(BellaInterrupt::IPCC2);
    }
}
```

